  "description": "Powerful motor, wide tyres and plenty of comfort - the Iconic EVO 1 combines sporty confidence with a safe riding experience. Whether you are travelling on your daily commute or on demanding tours, this E-SUV will give you the full enjoyment of riding an e-bike everywhere. With the latest generation Bosch Performance Line CX drive, you always have the power and energy you need to master sporting challenges safely. The large Intuvia 100 display provides you with a clear overview of all important riding data.\n\nThe wide Schwalbe tyres not only offer outstanding comfort, but also roll confidently over changing surfaces. With the powerful lighting and the MonkeyLink Twinlights smartly integrated into the dropout, good visibility is guaranteed at all times on all routes. The clever MonkeyLink 2.0 interface for an additional front light or inductive smartphone charging completes the smart details.",
